  "title": "习近平考察嘉峪关关城",
  "date": "2019-08-20 13:27:22",
  "author": "新华社",
  "editor": "(责编：王珂园                     )",
  "article": "<div class=\"d2txt_con clearfix\">\n<p></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\n习近平总书记20日上午来到嘉峪关关城，登上城楼察看关城整体面貌，听取河西走廊长城、关隘历史文化情况介绍。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰）</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190820/90/10509293576428131242.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190820/54/13828292891098999718.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190820/38/6719243471922578610.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190820/83/12084977571026668559.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190820/90/2239391036994971666.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190820/35/9843193276087238931.jpg\"/></p>\n</div>",
  "text": [
    "习近平总书记20日上午来到嘉峪关关城，登上城楼察看关城整体面貌，听取河西走廊长城、关隘历史文化情况介绍。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰）"
  ]
